        <detaileddescription>
<para>Call this from the frmbuf_wr done-callback with the address of the frame that is ready for display (the read pointer buffer).</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>LumaAddr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>DDR address of the luma plane of the ready frame. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ChromaAddr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>DDR address of the chroma plane (LumaAddr + ChromaOffset).</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
